| **Log parsing** | Fragile `line.split(" ")` + nested `in` checks | Three compiled `re.compile()` patterns; `parse_log_line()` returns a typed `NamedTuple` |
| **Types** | None | `NamedTuple` for all data structures; `list[ParsedError]` etc. throughout |
